'''''Dawn, Shine at the World's End''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[The Fall at Dawn's Rise]].

==Steps==
# Escape quickly and return to Marmoreal Palace
# Console the frightened residents
# Return to the lower floor of Marmoreal Palace
# Head to the Vortex of Genesis and complete the "Era Nova"

